    "long_instructions": "#Building Reusable Prompts with CHAT, Part 1\r\n\r\n**Context:** Extreme cold is a public safety emergency. You are building a **Warming Center Finder** to help citizens quickly locate safe havens nearby. Before asking the AI to write code, you must **decompose** the problem: analyze the raw data provided and decide exactly how it should look on the screen.\r\n\r\n1.  **Analyze the Data**: Look at the extended `centers` array in `script.js` and note the properties.\r\n2.  **Clarify**: Open `CHAT-Prompt.md` and locate the *Clarify* section. Use computational thinking to decompose design decisions and important features to implement.\r\n",
